00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:50.350
There is, like,
15-year-old program

00:06:50.350 --> 00:06:53.380
that I can run in a container
so I can accept requests.

00:06:53.380 --> 00:06:55.990
I get a Word file, and then
I give it to OpenOffice,

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:57.970
